# Customer Analytics & Retention Dashboards

Category: Data & Analytics

Track customer behavior, purchase habits, churn risk, and customer lifetime value in real time.

Acquiring a new customer costs 5x more than keeping an existing one. Our Customer Analytics solutions build data engines that monitor customer activity, identify accounts at risk of churning, segment buyers by loyalty tiers, and optimize lifetime value.

Key features:
- Churn Risk Engine: Flag clients who show drop-offs in usage or purchase volume. Preempt account losses.
